  "Which of the following statements is true with respect to the present value of a future amount?\nA. A The higher the discount rate, the higher the present value of a single sum for a given time period.\nB. B The relationship between present value and time is exponential.\nC. C The greater the time period, the higher the present value of a single sum for a given interest rate.\nD. D The lower the discount rate, the lower the present value of a single sum for a given time period.\nB",
